  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A player's volume can no longer be reduced to 0%, which means they would still be audible.\nThe minimum value is now 5%. I am uncertain whether this was intended.\n(Note: Due to a bug that existed before the beta, there is only a 2 dB difference between 0% and 5% volume. Once fixed, the difference would be -∞ .\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/audio-controls-reduce-volume-2x-more-quickly-than-they-should)",
